The C kinematics against the tilted work plane maths.

The two nutating-head configs carry their orientation maths in python,
remap_funcs_twp.py, written independently of the kinematics modules.
This test loads each module in realtime and puts its tool frame next to
the python transformation matrix over a grid of head angles, and its
tool frame inverse next to the python candidate joint angles and virtual
rotation for a set of requested tool axes.  Where they disagree, one of
the two has the sign or the order of a rotation wrong.
